0","kind":"announcement","title":"We Listen to Our Players!","summary":"We're the dev team behind Dino Epoch: Fantasy Tale.Our game is officially taking part in the Steam Next Fest. As a project still very much in the polishing stage, we were blown away by the attention we got on day one. We know the numbers might look tiny next to the big studios, but for our small team this is real, tangible encouragement! A huge thank-you to every player who checked us out right from the start!Quick plug — please, pretty please, give us a follow and add us to your Wishlist! We're","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:03:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027785","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:37:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4528660-1844115010501130","game_id":"steam-4528660","kind":"announcement","title":"《DinoEpoch FantasyTale》EAPLY ACCESS","summary":"《DinoEpoch FantasyTale》EAPLY ACCESS✅ New Feature: Co-op Team Gameplay Multiplayer online mode is officially available in this playtest! Ditch solo adventures, explore the open world, tackle tough dungeons and fight powerful bosses alongside friends. Sandbox building, creature raising and dungeon runs are all playable in co-op, boosting freedom and social fun.✅ Upgrade: Revamped Bullet-Hell Combat This version brings full combat polish! Bullet patterns are reworked, bosses gain new bullet attacks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T11:41:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501130","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4528660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:52:29Z","error_cod